ding"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":" allows you to convert a formatted representation into a data type, using one of two approaches:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initialize the data type by calling an initializer of that type that takes a formatted instance and a parse strategy as parameters. For example, you can create a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal"},{"type":"text","text":" from a formatted string with the initializer "},{"code":"Decimal.init(_:format:lenient:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from the FoundationInternationalization module."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a parse strategy and call its "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/parse(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method on one or more formatted instances."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is closely related to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/FormatStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which provides the opposite conversion: from data type to formatted representation. To use a parse strategy, you create a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/FormatStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to define the representation you expect, then access the style’s "},{"type":